WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:25.052
Kip was asleep in his hole one night. Crack!

2
00:00:25.053 --> 00:00:29.231
Thunder boomed and rain fell.

3
00:00:29.232 --> 00:00:32.687
Branches snapped.

4
00:00:32.688 --> 00:00:36.270
The whole tree shook.

5
00:00:36.271 --> 00:00:46.631
"Ahh!" Kip cried.

6
00:00:46.632 --> 00:00:53.866
The next morning the storm was over.

7
00:00:53.867 --> 00:00:58.948
Kip woke up in his kitchen.

8
00:00:58.949 --> 00:01:02.095
His bed was floating in water.

9
00:01:02.096 --> 00:01:05.353
Acorns bobbed nearby.

10
00:01:05.354 --> 00:01:08.425
"Oh no!" cried Kip.

11
00:01:08.426 --> 00:01:12.949
"My hole is flooded!"

12
00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:15.351
Just then Kip heard Bird.

13
00:01:15.352 --> 00:01:18.928
"My nest is ruined!" she cried.

14
00:01:18.929 --> 00:01:23.783
Kip went outside and looked down.

15
00:01:23.784 --> 00:01:27.798
Leaves and sticks were everywhere.

16
00:01:27.799 --> 00:01:30.260
Bird was on her branch.

17
00:01:30.261 --> 00:01:35.621
Her nest was a mess.

18
00:01:35.622 --> 00:01:39.287
"This is terrible, Bird," said Kip.

19
00:01:39.288 --> 00:01:42.673
"Our homes are ruined."

20
00:01:42.674 --> 00:01:47.876
"We can fix them," said Bird.

21
00:01:47.877 --> 00:01:51.037
"That's too much work," said Kip.

22
00:01:51.038 --> 00:01:53.285
"I have a better idea."

23
00:01:53.286 --> 00:01:56.363
"What's your idea?" asked Bird.

24
00:01:56.364 --> 00:01:58.876
"Let's move," said Kip.

25
00:01:58.877 --> 00:02:02.898
"Let's find a new tree!"
